<title>Libya: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/libya/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-libya-2026-11-23T15:05:04.863Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 15:05:04 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Ukrainian naval drones have struck two Russian vessels at Libya's Benghazi naval base and off its coast, sinking one warship and damaging another. The attacks extend a recent series of drone strikes on Russian ships in Libyan waters. Libyan forces continue shelling Haftar positions while some Haftar militia have surrendered at a strategic airbase, and Turkish officials have publicly welcomed a motion supporting the troops. An armed group blocked the Hamada oil pipeline for over 20 days, costing the National Oil Corporation $31 million in losses. There were 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261123-zelensky-says-ukraine-sank-russian-warship-off-libya&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261123-ukraine-claims-strikes-on-russian-ships-off-libyan-coast&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261123-ukraine-sending-the-message-that-we-can-attack-you-where-we-want&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/23/world/europe/ukraine-libya-russian-ships.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168857&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/23/ukraine-naval-drones-strike-russian-warship-libya&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cr894gjz0j0yo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/videos/c6wy93q5wwqvo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/23/russian-ships-hit-by-drones-off-libya-coast-what-do-we-know?traffic_s